		(layer "F.Cu")
		(uuid "6892ff80-26eb-4a24-86c0-2b62a4f11dfc")
		(at 36 36)
		(descr "4 THT pads under the Adafruit NeoPixel Ring 24's IN/+5V/GND/OUT solder points (JP1/JP3/JP4/JP2), for pin-mounting the module. Coordinates taken from Adafruit's own board file -- github.com/adafruit/Adafruit-NeoPixel-Ring, 'Adafruit NeoPixel Ring 24 B.brd' -- with Y negated for KiCad's downward Y. Signals read from that file's netlist, not assumed: JP1=IN (through R1), JP2=OUT (LED24 DOUT), JP3=VDD, JP4=GND. All four sit at r=31.59, inside the ring's 26.16..32.77 material band. The same extraction reproduces ModuleMountPads_4's Ring 16 pads exactly, which is how it was checked.")
