		(at 59.5 42.5 -90)
		(descr "Seeed Studio XIAO RP2350, 21x17.8mm, reflow/castellated (SMD) mounting. VENDORED VERBATIM from Seeed's own KiCad library -- github.com/Seeed-Studio/OPL_Kicad_Library, 'Seeed Studio XIAO Series Library/XIAO-RP2350-SMD.kicad_mod' -- with only the footprint NAME changed to match this file. Nothing here is eyeballed or measured off a photo, same rule as ModuleMountPads_Ring24. Pad map is from the matching Seeed symbol (Seeed_Studio_XIAO_Series.kicad_sym), not assumed: 1-11=D0..D10, 12=3V3_OUT, 13=GND, 14=VBUS, 15-22=D11..D18, 23=SWDIO, 24=SWDCLK, 25=EN, 26=GND, 27=BOOT, 28=3V3_OUT, 29=VBAT, 30=GND. Pads 15-30 are UNDERSIDE pads: they need copper keepout under the module even where unconnected.")
